<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Web APP DC - 
        <% if (LanguageContext == "IT") { %>
            Password dimenticata?
        <% } else if (LanguageContext == "GB") { %>
            Forgotten password?
        <% } else if (LanguageContext == "ES") { %>
            Olvidaste tu contrase&ntilde;a
        <% } else if (LanguageContext == "CN") { %>
            忘記密碼？
        <% } %>
    </title>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <%- include('partials/head'); %>
    <script type="text/javascript" src="/utility-script"></script>
    <script type="text/javascript" src="/validation-script"></script>
    <script type="text/javascript" src="/password-recovery-script"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-light">
    <form name="frmPasswordRecovery" id="frmPasswordRecovery" method="post" action="/password-recovery" class="was-validated" novalidate>
        <input type="hidden" name="LanguageContext" id="LanguageContext" value="<%= LanguageContext %>" />
        <div class="container min-vh-100 d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center py-4">
            <div class="row justify-content-center w-100">
                <div class="col-12 col-sm-10 col-md-8 col-lg-6 col-xl-5" style="max-width: 520px;">
                    <div class="card login border shadow-sm position-relative">
                        <div id="select-container" class="position-absolute top-0 end-0 m-3 z-3" style="left: auto; transform: none;">
                            <ul>
                            <li data-target="recovery" class="IT" lang-selection="IT" tooltip="IT" flow="down">
                                <img src="/images/flags/it.svg" alt="IT">
                            </li>
                            <!--li data-target="recovery" class="ES" lang-selection="ES" tooltip="ES" flow="down">
                                <img src="/images/flags/es.svg" alt="ES">
                            </li-->
                            <!--li data-target="recovery" class="CN" lang-selection="CN" tooltip="CN" flow="down">
                                <img src="/images/flags/cn.svg" alt="CN">
                            </li-->
                            <li data-target="recovery" class="GB" lang-selection="GB" tooltip="GB" flow="down">
                                <img src="/images/flags/gb.svg" alt="GB">
                            </li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body p-4 pt-3">
                            <div class="text-center mb-3">
                                <img src="/images/password-recovery.png" class="img-fluid" alt="Password Recovery">
                            </div>

                            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">
                                <% if (LanguageContext == "IT") { %>
                                    Password dimenticata?
                                <% } else if (LanguageContext == "GB") { %>
                                    Lost password?
                                <% } else if (LanguageContext == "ES") { %>
                                    Has perdido tu contrase&ntilde;a?
                                <% } else if (LanguageContext == "CN") { %>
                                    忘记密码？
                                <% } %>
                            </h4>

                            <% if (error) { %>
                                <div class="alert alert-danger form-errors d-flex align-items-center mb-3" role="alert">
                                    <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill flex-shrink-0 me-2 fs-5"></i>
                                    <div class="pnl-errors"><%= error %></div>
                                </div>
                            <% } %>

                            <div class="mb-3">
                                <input class="form-control form-control-lg" type="email" name="email" id="email" required placeholder="@mail.com">
                                <div class="valid-feedback"></div>
                            </div>

                            <p class="text-secondary small mb-4">
                                <% if (LanguageContext == "IT") { %>
                                    Digita il tuo indirizzo e-mail, se corrisponde ad un account registrato nel sistema, riceverai un codice di verifica che dovrai utilizzare al prossimo passaggio.
                                <% } else if (LanguageContext == "GB") { %>
                                    Enter your email address and, if it corresponds to a system registered account, will receive a verification code that will have to use in the next step.
                                <% } else if (LanguageContext == "ES") { %>
                                    Ingresa tu direcci&oacute;n de correo electr&oacute;nico, si corresponde a una cuenta registrada en el sistema, recibir&aacute;s un c&oacute;digo de verificaci&oacute;n que deber&aacute;s utilizar en el siguiente paso.
                                <% } else if (LanguageContext == "CN") { %>
                                    请输入您的电子邮箱，如果此邮箱已在系统中注册，您将收到一封包含验证码的邮件，在下一步操作中，请使用此验证码 
                                <% } %>
                            </p>

                            <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" style="background-color: #1763a1; border-color: #1763a1;">
                                    <% if (LanguageContext == "IT") { %>
                                        Avanti
                                    <% } else if (LanguageContext == "GB") { %>
                                        Forward
                                    <% } else if (LanguageContext == "ES") { %>
                                        Siguiente paso
                                    <% } else if (LanguageContext == "CN") { %>
                                        下一步
                                    <% } %>
                                </button>
                                <a href="/login/<%= LanguageContext %>" class="btn btn-light btn-lg border text-secondary">
                                    <% if (LanguageContext == "IT") { %>
                                        Indietro
                                    <% } else if (LanguageContext == "GB") { %>
                                        Back
                                    <% } else if (LanguageContext == "ES") { %>
                                        Paso anterior
                                    <% } else if (LanguageContext == "CN") { %>
                                        上一步
                                    <% } %>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </form>
</body>
</html>